---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-purple-50/30 to-white"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="absolute -inset-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary/10 to-primary/10 rounded-3xl -rotate-2"></div>
        <img
          src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/computer.png"
          alt="Tech support"
          class="relative w-48 h-48 lg:w-72 lg:h-72 drop-shadow-xl"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary text-sm font-semibold">
          Helpdesk
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">
          Do What You Do Best
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            We'll Handle The Rest
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          On demand helpdesk support is important for small business owners to invest in because it provides them with access to professional technical support when they need it. This can help them quickly resolve technical issues and keep their business running smoothly.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Additionally, having a helpdesk support service can help small business owners save time and money by providing them with access to expert advice and assistance, rather than needing to hire a full-time IT staff.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
